// title: I Am Inevitable
// xp: 25
// hint: Split the sentence into words, reverse their order, join them again, then make it upper case.
// hint: `sentence.split(" ").reversed().join(" ").to_upper()`
//
// Villains talk backwards when they monologue (it's in the contract).
// `monologue` should reverse the order of the words of a sentence and shout
// it: `"i am inevitable"` becomes `"INEVITABLE AM I"`.
//
// Strings have `split(sep)`, which gives a `[str]`; lists have `reversed()`
// and, for strings, `join(sep)`; and strings have `to_upper()`. Chain them.
#test("i am inevitable")["INEVITABLE AM I"]
#test("snap")["SNAP"]
fun monologue(sentence: str) -> str {
    return sentence
}
